<section class="section section-dark" id="panel">
    <div class="wrap panel-split">
        <div>
        <div class="section-head reveal">
            <span class="eyebrow">Panel administracyjny</span>
            <h2>Jeden panel, wszystkie skrzynki</h2>
            <p>Czytelny panel po polsku, z trybem jasnym i ciemnym. Konta, listy, kwarantanna, statystyki i konfiguracja w jednym miejscu.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-grid">
            <article class="panel-card reveal"><div class="feature-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="m7 15 4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></div><h3>Pulpit</h3><p>Skuteczność ochrony, liczba spamu i kwarantanny, najczęstsi spamerzy.</p></article>
            <article class="panel-card reveal"><div class="feature-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 10h-1.3A8 8 0 1 0 9 20h9a5 5 0 0 0 0-10z"/></svg></div><h3>Konta</h3><p>Test połączenia, wdrożenie agenta, synchronizacja reguł i skan na żądanie.</p></article>
            <article class="panel-card reveal"><div class="feature-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-6l-2 3h-4l-2-3H2"/><path d="M5.5 5.1 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.5-6.9A2 2 0 0 0 16.8 4H7.2a2 2 0 0 0-1.7 1.1z"/></svg></div><h3>Folder spamu i kwarantanna</h3><p>Przegląd złapanych wiadomości i przywracanie fałszywych alarmów.</p></article>
            <article class="panel-card reveal"><div class="feature-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3 1.8l.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8 2.8l-.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.8-.3 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1 1.5V21a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.1-1.5 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.8.3l-.1.1a2 2 0 1 1-2.8-2.8l.1-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 .3-1.8 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5-1H3a2 2 0 1 1 0-4h.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.5-1.1 1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3-1.8l-.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8-2.8l.1.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.8.3H9a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1-1.5V3a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1 1.5 1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.8-.3l.1-.1a2 2 0 1 1 2.8 2.8l-.1.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-.3 1.8V9a1.7 1.7 0 0 0 1.5 1H21a2 2 0 1 1 0 4h-.1a1.7 1.7 0 0 0-1.5 1z"/></svg></div><h3>Ustawienia filtra</h3><p>Progi, wagi sygnałów, ClamAV, VirusTotal i wspólna baza.</p></article>
        </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="login-card reveal" id="logowanie" aria-labelledby="login-title">
            {% if app.user %}
                <h3 id="login-title">Jesteś zalogowany</h3>
                <p class="login-lead">Zalogowano jako <strong>{{ app.user.userIdentifier }}</strong>.</p>
                <a class="btn btn-primary login-submit" href="{{ panel_url }}">
                    Przejdź do panelu
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
